{
    "chapter_num": 17,
    "verses_count": 13,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Micah’s Idolatry"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there was a man from the mountains of Ephraim, whose name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Micah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to his mother, “The eleven hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shekels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of silver that were taken from you, and on which you put a curse, even saying it in my ears—here "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the silver with me; I took it.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his mother said, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "May you be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " blessed by the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", my son!” "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when he had returned the eleven hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shekels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of silver to his mother, his mother said, “I had wholly dedicated the silver from my hand to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for my son, to make a carved image and a molded image; now therefore, I will return it to you.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus he returned the silver to his mother. Then his mother took two hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shekels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of silver and gave them to the silversmith, and he made it into a carved image and a molded image; and they were in the house of Micah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The man Micah had a shrine, and made an ephod and household"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. teraphim"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " idols; and he consecrated one of his sons, who became his priest. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In those days "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no king in Israel; everyone did "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "what was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " right in his own eyes."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there was a young man from Bethlehem in Judah, of the family of Judah; he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a Levite, and was staying there. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The man departed from the city of Bethlehem in Judah to stay wherever he could find "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "a place."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Then he came to the mountains of Ephraim, to the house of Micah, as he journeyed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Micah said to him, “Where do you come from?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he said to him, “I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a Levite from Bethlehem in Judah, and I am on my way to find "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "a place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to stay.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Micah said to him, “Dwell with me, and be a father and a priest to me, and I will give you ten "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shekels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of silver per year, a suit of clothes, and your sustenance.” So the Levite went in. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Levite was content to dwell with the man; and the young man became like one of his sons to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Micah consecrated"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. filled the hand of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Levite, and the young man became his priest, and lived in the house of Micah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Micah said, “Now I know that the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will be good to me, since I have a Levite as priest!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}